{"id":"wb-7-36","name":"匼河遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"匼河遗址","text":"匼河遗址（匼音kē），位于山西省运城市芮城县风陵渡镇匼河村一带，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n1965年5月24日，公布为山西省文物保护单位，编号1-10。2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位，是一座古遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%BC%E6%B2%B3%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":89626730,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89626730","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/436db87d18eafd013358685d.jpg","title":"師氏劍齒象化石.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B8%AB%E6%B0%8F%E5%8A%8D%E9%BD%92%E8%B1%A1%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/%E5%B8%AB%E6%B0%8F%E5%8A%8D%E9%BD%92%E8%B1%A1%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"淺藍雪","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​出土於山西省芮城匼河遺址的師氏劍齒象化石，距今約80萬年","width":320,"height":180}}